'''High Voltage''' (暴走高圧バッテリー, ''Bōsō Kōatsu Batterī'', '''High-Voltage Battery Out of Control''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

